        "TileImage": "$($repository 42d6d05e-356f-4e36-92ed-f9817b59497d).Image",
        "Description": "HILDE SORBETTO is a former dutchess that is accused of attemping to create a breakout state in our clients nation. In return, they will release two our of operatives along with pardoning a former client. While these deals usually are not made it is in the best interest of both parties to handle this. Your mission is to eliminate Dutchess Hilde Sorbetto, her uncle and main strategist Dr. Singh, and lastly their assistant Raafida Al-Salem. In doing so we eliminate all possible resistance leaders.",
